r src-261028-0lka "NASA EO Creede Caldera ASTER still (public domain), proposed by showrunner-planet-extremes" "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/volcanic-rocks-southwestern-colorado-8720/ ; credit line: NASA image created by Jesse Allen, using data provided courtesy of NASA/GSFC/METI/ERSDAC/JAROS, and U.S./Japan ASTER Science Team. Shows Creede Caldera (not La Garita itself; labelled as such). $EV_NASA"
for a in dtd8 y8ny zu0b 013o tfmg tg02 w46k 98ui; do
 r src-261028-$a "Original studio graphic (volume cubes), proposed by showrunner-planet-extremes" "Drawn by scripts/pe-erupt-scale.py with PIL from numbers only (USGS-published volumes: https://www.usgs.gov/observatories/yvo/news/pantheon-caldera-eruptions-where-does-yellowstone-rank ; https://www.usgs.gov/volcanoes/yellowstone/science/summary-yellowstone-eruption-history ; https://www.usgs.gov/observatories/yvo/news/discovery-ancient-super-eruptions-suggests-yellowstone-hotspot-may-be-waning ; Pinatubo https://pubs.usgs.gov/fs/1997/fs113-97/). No third-party imagery. Font Cairo Black/Bold, SIL OFL 1.1 (data/brand/quiz-ar/fonts/OFL.txt)."
